# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. The park re-reads the fence but only checks
# it is unpaused: a delivery admitted before the pause and parked after the lift
# takes the fresh epoch and drains onto the restored copy.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedParkKeepsStaleAdmission
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a park after the lift re-stamps a delivery admitted before the pause
PERTURBS: Park

--- FIND
       IN IF ~recvOn[d] \/ r.ep < epoch[d]
--- REPLACE
       IN \* MUTATION: the admission epoch is not compared.
          IF ~recvOn[d]
--- END
